<LanguageData>
  <VQE_Deadlife_AncientICBMLaunchSite.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription->We have intercepted a broadcast at a recently raided underground silo: Operation: Deadlife is now underway. Enough resource silos have been breached, and the plan has been set in motion. The broadcast confirms that [General_nameFull] has initiated final preparations at an ancient ICBM launch site.\n\nRefueling of the devastating missiles is in progress. These warheads are armed with deadlife dust payloads and if launched, they will detonate high in orbit, spreading a near-permanent death pall across the planet. It is likely that endless hordes of shamblers will then scour the world, consuming or destroying all remaining civilization.\n\nWe have traced the origin of the signal to the ICBM launch facility. We must travel there and stop [General_nameFull] before the launch sequence can be completed. The site is expected to be heavily defended, not only swarming with shamblers, but also protected by restored automated defenses.\n\n[General_nameFull] will activate numerous defensive systems from the facility’s control room: opening sealed death pits, releasing shambler animals from containment kennels, flooding the complex with rotstink gas, and awakening elite deadlife officers from cryogenic caskets.\n\nOnly by reaching and destroying the launch terminal can we prevent the missiles from firing. Failure to stop the launch in time, or ignoring this threat entirely, will doom the planet to a global shambler apocalypse.\n\nThis is our only chance to end Operation: Deadlife once and for all.-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;我们在最近突袭的一个地下发射井中截获了一段广播：“死亡行动”正在进行中。足够的资源孤岛已经被突破，并且该计划已经启动。广播确认[General_nameFull]已在古老的洲际弹道导弹发射场开始最后准备工作。

毁灭性导弹的加油正在进行中。这些弹头配备了致命尘埃有效载荷，一旦发射，它们将在轨道高处爆炸，在地球上散布近乎永久的死亡阴影。随后，无数的流浪者很可能会席卷世界，吞噬或摧毁所有剩余的文明。

我们已将信号的来源追溯到洲际弹道导弹发射设施。我们必须前往那里并 停止 [General_nameFull] 才能完成发射序列。该地点预计将受到严密防守，不仅挤满了漫步者，而且还受到恢复的自动化防御的保护。

[General_nameFull]将从设施的控制室激活众多防御系统：打开密封的死亡坑，从收容所中释放漫步者动物，用腐臭气体淹没整个建筑群，并将精英死亡官员从低温中唤醒

只有到达并摧毁发射终端才能阻止导弹发射。如果未能及时停止发射，或者完全忽视这一威胁，地球将注定陷入全球性的灾难。

这是我们一劳永逸地结束“死亡行动”的唯一机会。</li>
  </VQE_Deadlife_AncientICBMLaunchSite.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_Deadlife_AncientICBMLaunchSite.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questName->ancient ICBM launch site-->
    <li>questName-&gt;古代洲际弹道导弹发射场</li>
  </VQE_Deadlife_AncientICBMLaunchSite.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_Deadlife_AncientSilo.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)->[asker_nameDef], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has informed us of the location of a sealed entrance to one of the [ancientSilos] left behind during Operation: Deadlife, a planet-spanning initiative launched by a [longDeadGovernment] in preparation for global catastrophe.\n\nThese silos were designed to remain sealed for generations, [intention]. Inside, it's believed they contain [containedReward]. The deeper chambers are rumored to hold equipment and supplies capable of restarting civilization itself.\n\n[threat]. [importantLight]. Without the light, you’ll be navigating blind and vulnerable to attack.\n\n[commandMap]. Studying these might reveal the locations of other silos, and more importantly, bring us closer to discovering the Command Headquarters, the nerve center of Operation: Deadlife, where the truth behind this apocalyptic plan may still lie buried.\n\n[questObjective].-->
    <li>questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)-&gt;[asker_nameDef]、[asker_faction_name] 的 [asker_faction_leaderTitle] 已告知我们在“死亡生命”行动期间留下的 [ancientSilos] 之一的密封入口的位置，这是一项由 [longDeadGovernment] 发起的跨行星倡议，为全球行动做准备灾难。

这些筒仓被设计为世代保持密封，[intention]。据信它们的内部含有[containedReward]。据传，更深的密室里藏着能够重启文明的设备和补给品。

[threat]。 [importantLight]。如果没有灯光，您将在盲目中航行并且容易受到攻击。

[commandMap]。研究这些可能会揭示其他孤岛的位置，更重要的是，让我们更接近发现指挥总部，即死亡行动的神经中枢，这个世界末日计划背后的真相可能仍然埋藏在那里。

[questObjective]。</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==True)->The ancient battle maps have revealed to us the location of a sealed entrance to one of the [ancientSilos] left behind during Operation: Deadlife, a planet-spanning initiative launched by a [longDeadGovernment] in preparation for global catastrophe.\n\nThese silos were designed to remain sealed for generations, [intention]. Inside, it's believed they contain [containedReward]. The deeper chambers are rumored to hold equipment and supplies capable of restarting civilization itself.\n\n[threat]. [importantLight]. Without the light, you’ll be navigating blind and vulnerable to attack.\n\n[commandMap]. Studying these might reveal the locations of other silos, and more importantly, bring us closer to discovering the Command Headquarters, the nerve center of Operation: Deadlife, where the truth behind this apocalyptic plan may still lie buried.\n\n[questObjective].-->
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==True)-&gt;古代战斗地图向我们揭示了在“死亡生命行动”期间留下的[ancientSilos]之一的密封入口的位置，这是一项由[longDeadGovernment]发起的跨行星倡议，为全球灾难做准备。

这些筒仓被设计为在几代人中保持密封， [intention]。据信它们的内部含有[containedReward]。据传，更深的密室里藏着能够重启文明的设备和补给品。

[threat]。 [importantLight]。如果没有灯光，您将在盲目中航行并且容易受到攻击。

[commandMap]。研究这些可能会揭示其他孤岛的位置，更重要的是，让我们更接近发现指挥总部，即死亡行动的神经中枢，这个世界末日计划背后的真相可能仍然埋藏在那里。

[questObjective]。</li>
    <!--EN: ancientSilos->ancient military silos-->
    <li>ancientSilos-&gt;古代军事筒仓</li>
    <!--EN: ancientSilos->sealed war-era bunkers-->
    <li>ancientSilos-&gt;密封的战争时期掩体</li>
    <!--EN: ancientSilos->abandoned military silos-->
    <li>ancientSilos-&gt;废弃的军事筒仓</li>
    <!--EN: ancientSilos->pre-collapse resource vaults-->
    <li>ancientSilos-&gt;崩溃前的资源库</li>
    <!--EN: ancientSilos->forgotten subterranean complexes-->
    <li>ancientSilos-&gt;被遗忘的地下建筑群</li>
    <!--EN: ancientSilos->deep-storage logistics sites-->
    <li>ancientSilos-&gt;深储物流站点</li>
    <!--EN: ancientSilos->decaying military storage facilities-->
    <li>ancientSilos-&gt;腐烂的军事储存设施</li>
    <!--EN: ancientSilos->bunkered infrastructure sites-->
    <li>ancientSilos-&gt;掩体基础设施站点</li>
    <!--EN: ancientSilos->deadlife supply silos-->
    <li>ancientSilos-&gt;死亡供应筒仓</li>
    <!--EN: longDeadGovernment->long-dead government-->
    <li>longDeadGovernment-&gt;早已消亡的政府</li>
    <!--EN: longDeadGovernment->ancient planetary alliance-->
    <li>longDeadGovernment-&gt;古代行星联盟</li>
    <!--EN: longDeadGovernment->collapsed technocratic regime-->
    <li>longDeadGovernment-&gt;崩溃的技术官僚政权</li>
    <!--EN: longDeadGovernment->extinct militarized government-->
    <li>longDeadGovernment-&gt;军事化政府已不复存在</li>
    <!--EN: longDeadGovernment->forgotten emergency council-->
    <li>longDeadGovernment-&gt;被遗忘的紧急委员会</li>
    <!--EN: longDeadGovernment->defunct crisis-state authority-->
    <li>longDeadGovernment-&gt;已不复存在的危机国家当局</li>
    <!--EN: longDeadGovernment->long-vanished defense network-->
    <li>longDeadGovernment-&gt;消失已久的防御网络</li>
    <!--EN: longDeadGovernment->fallen civil defense command-->
    <li>longDeadGovernment-&gt;倒下的民防司令部</li>
    <!--EN: intention->intended to be opened only when humanity faced collapse-->
    <li>intention-&gt;仅在人类面临崩溃时才打开</li>
    <!--EN: intention->built to withstand centuries and reopen in humanity’s darkest hour-->
    <li>intention-&gt;能够承受几个世纪的考验，并在人类最黑暗的时刻重新开放</li>
    <!--EN: intention->designed as failsafe supply nodes for rebuilding civilization-->
    <li>intention-&gt;设计为重建文明的故障安全供应节点</li>
    <!--EN: intention->meant to be activated only during a planetary extinction event-->
    <li>intention-&gt;仅在行星灭绝事件期间激活</li>
    <!--EN: intention->set to unlock once the collapse protocols were confirmed-->
    <li>intention-&gt;设置为在崩溃协议确认后解锁</li>
    <!--EN: intention->intended to serve as last-resort caches for surviving factions-->
    <li>intention-&gt;旨在作为幸存派系的最后手段缓存</li>
    <!--EN: containedReward->vast stockpiles of resources: steel, plasteel, medicine, weaponry, and even preserved cultural relics-->
    <li>containedReward-&gt;大量资源库存：钢铁、塑料、药品、武器，甚至保存完好的文物</li>
    <!--EN: containedReward->a wealth of resources: hardened rations, components, medical supplies, and munitions-->
    <li>containedReward-&gt;丰富的资源：硬化口粮、零部件、医疗用品和弹药</li>
    <!--EN: containedReward->critical survival materials: building materials, medicines, weapons, and schematics-->
    <li>containedReward-&gt;关键生存材料：建筑材料、药品、武器和原理图</li>
    <!--EN: containedReward->tools to rebuild: fuel, tools, seeds, weapons, and encrypted blueprints-->
    <li>containedReward-&gt;重建工具：燃料、工具、种子、武器和加密蓝图</li>
    <!--EN: containedReward->enough equipment to sustain or restart a new colony-->
    <li>containedReward-&gt;足够的设备来维持或重新启动新的殖民地</li>
    <!--EN: containedReward->a treasure trove of essential gear, preserved through time-->
    <li>containedReward-&gt;历久弥新的基本装备宝库</li>
    <!--EN: threat->Yet the silos are not empty. The corridors within are completely lightless, and something hostile is said to lurk in the dark-->
    <li>threat-&gt;然而，筒仓并非空的。里面的走廊完全没有光，据说黑暗中潜伏着一些敌对的东西</li>
    <!--EN: threat->But time has not left them untouched. The interior is pitch black, and something stirs in the shadows-->
    <li>threat-&gt;但时间并没有让他们毫发无伤。屋内一片漆黑，阴影里有东西在搅动</li>
    <!--EN: threat->Explorers report movement inside: faint noises, heavy footsteps, shapes in the dark-->
    <li>threat-&gt;探险者报告内部有动静：微弱的噪音、沉重的脚步声、黑暗中的形状</li>
    <!--EN: threat->Survivors speak of hostile entities lurking in the corridors, unseen until it’s too late-->
    <li>threat-&gt;幸存者谈到走廊里潜伏着敌对实体，直到为时已晚才被发现</li>
    <!--EN: threat->Whatever remains inside is not dormant, something guards these forgotten halls-->
    <li>threat-&gt;里面剩下的东西都没有休眠，有东西守护着这些被遗忘的大厅</li>
    <!--EN: threat->The halls are quiet, but not empty. Something waits inside, cloaked in shadow-->
    <li>threat-&gt;大厅很安静，但并不空。有东西在里面等待着，隐藏在阴影中</li>
    <!--EN: importantLight->Activating the power and lighting systems inside is critical-->
    <li>importantLight-&gt;启动内部电源和照明系统至关重要</li>
    <!--EN: importantLight->Restoring power and activating lights will be vital to survival-->
    <li>importantLight-&gt;恢复电力和点亮灯光对于生存至关重要</li>
    <!--EN: importantLight->Without illumination, any movement inside the silo is suicide-->
    <li>importantLight-&gt;没有照明，筒仓内的任何移动都是自杀</li>
    <!--EN: importantLight->Light systems must be activated first, or you’ll be helpless in the dark-->
    <li>importantLight-&gt;必须先激活灯光系统，否则你将在黑暗中无助</li>
    <!--EN: importantLight->Sight is your only defense. Find a way to power the lights quickly-->
    <li>importantLight-&gt;视力是你唯一的防御手段。找到一种快速为灯供电的方法</li>
    <!--EN: importantLight->Unless you activate the lights, the silo will be a deathtrap-->
    <li>importantLight-&gt;除非您激活灯光，否则筒仓将成为死亡陷阱</li>
    <!--EN: commandMap->Each silo is also known to contain at least one ancient command desk or map table used to coordinate military movements-->
    <li>commandMap-&gt;每个发射井还包含至少一个古代指挥台或地图桌，用于协调军事行动</li>
    <!--EN: commandMap->Most silos house ancient desks or battle maps once used by field commanders-->
    <li>commandMap-&gt;大多数筒仓里都藏有战地指挥官曾经使用过的古老办公桌或战斗地图</li>
    <!--EN: commandMap->Tactical tables scattered inside may contain encrypted maps to other installations-->
    <li>commandMap-&gt;分散在内部的战术表可能包含其他设施的加密地图</li>
    <!--EN: commandMap->Buried among the supplies are command desks filled with strategic data-->
    <li>commandMap-&gt;掩埋在物资之中的是装满战略数据的指挥台</li>
    <!--EN: commandMap->Decoding the maps on-site could reveal new locations tied to Operation: Deadlife-->
    <li>commandMap-&gt;现场解码地图可以揭示与“死亡行动”相关的新地点</li>
    <!--EN: commandMap->Intact terminals and war tables could lead us to the central command-->
    <li>commandMap-&gt;完好无损的终端和战争表可以引导我们到达中央指挥部</li>
    <!--EN: questObjective->The quest will complete once you loot at least a quarter of resources from the silo-->
    <li>questObjective-&gt;一旦您从筒仓中掠夺了至少四分之一的资源，任务就会完成</li>
    <!--EN: questObjective->Loot at least 25% of the total resources stored in the silo to complete the quest-->
    <li>questObjective-&gt;掠夺筒仓中至少 25% 的总资源才能完成任务</li>
    <!--EN: questObjective->The mission ends once a significant portion of the stored goods have been secured-->
    <li>questObjective-&gt;一旦大部分储存货物得到保护，任务就会结束</li>
    <!--EN: questObjective->Successfully extracting a quarter of the silo’s contents will fulfill the objective-->
    <li>questObjective-&gt;成功提取筒仓内容物的四分之一即可实现目标</li>
    <!--EN: questObjective->You’ll need to claim at least a fourth of the silo’s supplies to mark this operation complete-->
    <li>questObjective-&gt;您需要领取至少四分之一的筒仓补给才能标记此操作完成</li>
    <!--EN: questObjective->Once enough materials have been secured and hauled out, the quest will be marked complete-->
    <li>questObjective-&gt;一旦获得足够的材料并运出，任务将被标记为完成</li>
  </VQE_Deadlife_AncientSilo.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
